{"speciesId":793,"names":{"fr":"Zéroïd","es":"Nihilego","en":"Nihilego","ja":"ウツロイド"},"descriptions":[{"language":"fr","version":"sun","text":"L’une des mystérieuses Ultra-Chimères. On l’aurait vue parasiter des gens en pleine rue, les rendant extrêmement violents."},{"language":"es","version":"sun","text":"Un Ultraente envuelto en misterio. Se dice que las víctimas a las que posee se vuelven agresivas."},{"language":"en","version":"sun","text":"One of several mysterious Ultra Beasts. People on the street report observing those infested by it suddenly becoming violent."},{"language":"ja","version":"sun","text":"謎に 包まれた ＵＢの 一種。 街ゆく 人が 寄生され 暴れだす 姿が 目撃された。"},{"language":"fr","version":"moon","text":"Nul ne sait si cette Ultra-Chimère possède une conscience propre, mais on l’aurait aperçue en train d’imiter les gestes d’une jeune fille."},{"language":"es","version":"moon","text":"Se desconoce si este Ultraente posee consciencia propia, pero en ocasiones se comporta como una chica joven."},{"language":"en","version":"moon","text":"One of the Ultra Beasts. It’s unclear whether or not this Pokémon is sentient, but sometimes it can be observed behaving like a young girl."},{"language":"ja","version":"moon","text":"ＵＢの 一種。 意思が あるかは 不明だが 時折 少女の ような 仕草を みせる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Une forme de vie d’un autre monde, communément appelée « Ultra-Chimère ». On la pense porteuse d’une violente neurotoxine."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Una forma de vida de otro mundo conocida como Ultraente. Se cree que posee una neurotoxina muy potente."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-sun","text":"A life-form from another world, it was dubbed a UB and is thought to produce a strong neurotoxin."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-sun","text":"ＵＢと 呼ばれる 別世界の 生命体。 強い 神経毒を 持っていると 考えられる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Il est venu dans ce monde à travers une Ultra-Brèche. Tel un parasite, il aurait besoin d’un hôte, Pokémon ou humain, pour survivre."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Llegó a este mundo a través de un Ultraumbral. Es un parásito que se aprovecha de Pokémon y personas."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-moon","text":"It appeared in this world from an Ultra Wormhole. Nihilego appears to be a parasite that lives by feeding on people and Pokémon."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-moon","text":"ウルトラホールから この世界に 現れた。 ポケモンや 人間に 寄生して 生きているようだ。"}],"varieties":[{"id":793,"moves":[{"name":"pound","learns":[[17,"level-up",1],[18,"level-up",1],[20,"level-up",1]]},{"name":"bind","learns":[[18,"tutor",0]]},{"name":"headbutt","learns":[[17,"level-up",19],[18,"level-up",19],[20,"level-up",35]]},{"name":"body-slam","learns":[[20,"machine",0]]},{"name":"wrap","learns":[[20,"level-up",1]]},{"name":"acid","learns":[[17,"level-up",1],[18,"level-up",1],[20,"level-up",5]]},{"name":"thunderbolt","learns":[[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0],[20,"machine",0]]},{"name":"thunder-wave","learns":[[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0],[20,"machine",0]]},{"name":"thunder","learns":[[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0],[20,"machine",0]]},{"name":"toxic","learns":[[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0]]},{"name":"psychic","learns":[[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0],[20,"machine",0]]},{"name":"double-team","learns":[[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0]]},{"name":"light-screen","learns":[[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0],[20,"machine",0]]},{"name":"reflect","learns":[[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0]]},{"name":"constrict","learns":[[17,"level-up",1],[18,"level-up",1]]},{"name":"psywave","learns":[[17,"level-up",13],[18,"level-up",13]]},{"name":"rest","learns":[[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0],[20,"machine",0]]},{"name":"rock-slide","learns":[[20,"machine",0]]},{"name":"substitute","learns":[[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0],[20,"machine",0]]},{"name":"snore","learns":[[18,"tutor",0],[20,"machine",0]]},{"name":"spite","learns":[[18,"tutor",0]]},{"name":"protect","learns":[[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0],[20,"machine